  "foaf:name": "Ocean Dreams – Stories of Hope",
  "sdo:name": "Ocean Dreams – Stories of Hope",
  "sdo:description": "Ocean Dreams – Stories of Hope is a global IMAX documentary and educational initiative led by Voice of the Ocean in collaboration with UNESCO-IOC’s Ocean Literacy programme. The project translates leading marine science into accessible knowledge, highlighting ecosystem resilience and solutions aligned with the Ocean Decade vision and the 30x30 ambition. Distributed in over 200 museums worldwide, and supported by freely available educational materials, a dedicated digital platform, and a published book, Ocean Dreams expands equitable access to ocean knowledge, strengthens ocean literacy, and mobilises diverse audiences toward evidence-based action for a healthy and sustainable ocean.",
  "sdo:location": "Sweden",
  "sdo:identifier": "611",
  "sdo:url": "https://oceandecade.org/actions/ocean-dreams-stories-of-hope/",
